{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Stage 10 (plan, Settings: \"app.setting are … the app.id and such\"): the app's name is its setting, so the one\nplace it lives is app.setting (how app.pr and the settings rows become one store is the coder's trace first).",
  "step": [
